>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8 prose">
    <a href="/compliance" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">&larr; Back to Compliance</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-8">GDPR Compliance</h1>

    <p>The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is a comprehensive privacy law that protects the personal data of EU residents.</p>

    <h2>Data Processing</h2>
    <p>As an e-signature provider, usignpdf acts as a Data Processor for the documents you upload. We process personal data (like names, IP addresses, and emails required for the <a href="/security/audit-trails">Audit Trail</a>) strictly on your behalf.</p>

    <h2>Data Rights</h2>
    <p>We fully support the rights granted under GDPR, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Right to Erasure (Right to be Forgotten):</strong> You can delete documents and associated data from our systems. Note that deleting a document invalidates the ability to verify its audit trail in the future.</li>
        <li><strong>Right of Access:</strong> You can request a copy of all data we hold on you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data Residency</h2>
    <p>For enterprise customers, we offer the option to restrict data processing and storage entirely within EU datacenters (Frankfurt, Germany) to simplify compliance.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
